      "author": "copilot-pull-request-reviewer",
      "body": "The invalid-body test covers malformed JSON and the literal string \"null\", but it doesn’t cover an empty request body. Since `Json.Deserialize` throws on empty/whitespace input, add an empty-body case to prevent regressions and to confirm the endpoint returns BadRequest for this input.",
      "decision": "valid",
      "resolutionComment": "Added an empty-string InlineData case to RetrieveDocument_Returns_BadRequest_When_Body_Is_Invalid. This constructs a zero-length request body and verifies RetrieveDocument returns BadRequest when deserialization fails on empty input."
    }
